  "notes": "Word lists and rules for the Latin name generator. Game code is not included here. A pure function spec lives in /workspace/casa-game/design/government-guilds-legions-v0.1.md. Never emit the house-forbidden digit run (three sixes in a row). Never use eye words. All names are original to Casa O'Faydin; do not add Elder Scrolls names.",
